{"seq":5,"slug":"meta","title":"Meta","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/h/corporate-management/meta","rating":{"composite":4.28,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# Meta 简介\n\nMeta（原 Facebook）是全球最具影响力的科技公司之一，由 Mark Zuckerberg 于 2004 年在哈佛宿舍创立。截至 2026 年，Meta 拥有约 7.1 万名员工（经历多轮裁员后），日活用户超过 33 亿，年收入超过 2010 亿美元。从社交网络起家到押注元宇宙再到 All-in AI，Meta 正经历公司历史上最激进的战略转型——2026 年 AI 基础设施资本支出高达 1250-1450 亿美元，是人类商业史上最大规模的单年基础设施投资之一。\n\n本 Hub 从七个维度全面解析 Meta 的企业管理实践：\n\n第一章**文化与价值观**追溯\"Move Fast and Break Things\"的诞生与演变、Hacker Way 的制度化表达、2022 年六大核心价值观体系、三次使命重塑的组织代价、\"效率年\"到\"高强度之年\"的文化剧变，以及 Zuckerberg 双层股权架构下的创始人治理。\n\n第二章**绩效体系**深入分析 Meta 独特的半年绩效周期、备受争议的相对排名制度，以及在\"效率年\"背景下 PIP 文化对组织信任的侵蚀。\n\n第三章**组织与人才**聚焦 Bootcamp 新人项目的工程文化灌输、极致扁平的管理层级设计，以及内部自由转岗制度如何平衡人才留存与团队稳定。\n\n第四章**战略与方法论**剖析 Zuckerberg 创始人控制模式下的决策集中、元宇宙转型的组织重构逻辑，以及通过 React/PyTorch/Llama 开源构建技术生态的长期战略。\n\n第五章**职级与薪酬**全景拆解 Meta 的 IC 轨道（E3-E10）和管理轨道（M1-VP）职级体系、四维薪酬结构（Base + Signing Bonus + Annual Bonus + RSU）、PSC 绩效评估体系的完整机制，以及 2026 年的职场生存与晋升策略。\n\n第六章**角色与职业路径**按角色逐一剖析技术工程师（E3→E9 逐级展开、七大方向技术栈与晋升差异、IC vs 管理路线分叉）、产品经理、数据科学与机器学习工程师、设计师在 Meta 的成长阶梯和 AI 时代的角色重定义。\n\n第七章**AI 转型战略**系统解析 Meta 从社交巨头到 AI 基础设施公司的战略转型全貌——1250-1450 亿美元资本支出的投向逻辑、Llama 开源生态的战略意图与动摇、2022-2026 年累计裁员 33,000+ 人的组织重构、AI Pods 新型组织形态、以及从业者在转型中的个人职业杠杆。\n\n本 Hub 适合关注硅谷科技公司管理实践的技术从业者、管理者和 HR 从业者，以及正在评估是否加入或离开 Meta 的职场人士。每一章都以最新的数据和案例为基础，呈现 Meta 在 AI 时代的真实面貌与结构性变革。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"move-fast-evolution","title":"\"Move Fast\" 的演变","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/move-fast-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"be-bold-focus-impact","title":"\"Be Bold\" 与 \"Focus on Impact\"","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/be-bold-focus-impact"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hacker-way","title":"Hacker Way（黑客之道）","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/hacker-way"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-evolution","title":"Meta 使命愿景的演变历程","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/mission-evolution"},{"seq":5,"slug":"core-values-system","title":"Meta 核心价值观体系全景","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/core-values-system"},{"seq":6,"slug":"culture-crisis-and-shift","title":"Meta 文化危机与组织转型","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/culture-crisis-and-shift"},{"seq":7,"slug":"founder-gene-and-governance","title":"创始人基因与治理结构","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/culture-and-values/founder-gene-and-governance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semi-annual-review","title":"半年绩效周期","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/performance-system/semi-annual-review"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stack-ranking-controversy","title":"Stack Ranking 争议","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/performance-system/stack-ranking-controversy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"psc-rating-system","title":"PSC 评级体系详解","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/performance-system/psc-rating-system"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flat-hierarchy","title":"扁平层级","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/org-and-talent/flat-hierarchy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bootcamp-onboarding","title":"Bootcamp 新人入职","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/org-and-talent/bootcamp-onboarding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"internal-mobility","title":"内部转岗自由","url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/org-and-talent/internal-mobility"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/corporate-management/meta/strategy-and-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"me